  concept: 'Authored objective: Restore W401 protected drive authorization.

    Authored
    requirement: Open W401 during protected replay. Verify inhibit, reconnect, requalify
    and explicitly reset U3.

    General teaching principle: Motor behavior depends
    on drive conditions, load, feedback and protective limits; test the observed
    state at each authored checkpoint.

    Only fresh, authoritative game evidence
    can establish that this objective is complete.'
  analogy: A controlled wheel under varying load shows why a command does not always
    equal actual speed.
